---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - A.I.T Engineers" description="Privacy Policy and Data Protection Practices for A.I.T Engineers">
  <!-- Page Hero Banner -->
  <section class="hero hero--page" id="top">
    <div class="hero__media">
      <img class="hero__img" data-parallax="0.14"
           src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1496247749665-49cf5b1022e9?auto=format&fit=crop&w=2200&q=70"
           alt="" aria-hidden="true" fetchpriority="high">
    </div>
    <div class="hero__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero__grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="hero__sheen" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- CAD line graphics -->
    <svg class="hero__cad" viewBox="0 0 1440 900" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">
      <g class="cad-lines">
        <path class="draw" d="M-40 700 L420 700 L640 300 L1100 300 L1480 300"/>
        <path class="draw" d="M1480 780 L1080 780 L900 460 L520 460"/>
        <path class="draw" d="M180 900 L180 640 L340 380 L340 -20"/>
        <path class="draw" d="M1240 -20 L1240 220 L1360 430 L1360 900"/>
      </g>
    </svg>

    <div class="hero__inner shell hero__inner--page" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center;">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light hero__eyebrow">
        <span class="eyebrow__mark" aria-hidden="true"><svg><use href="#apex"/></svg></span>
        Legal & Transparency
      </p>

      <h1 class="hero__title hero__title--page">
        <span class="line">Privacy Policy</span>
      </h1>

      <nav class="crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <ol>
          <li><a href="/">Home / Privacy Policy</a></li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Content Section -->
  <section class="band band--white legal-content">
    <div class="shell" style="max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <div class="legal-card">
        <p class="legal-meta"><strong>Effective Date:</strong> January 1, 2026 &nbsp;|&nbsp; <strong>Last Updated:</strong> March 2026</p>

        <p class="legal-intro">
          At <strong>A.I.T Engineers</strong>, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting the confidentiality and security of personal and corporate information shared with us through our website, communications, and industrial engineering engagements.
        </p>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p>We collect information you provide directly to us when making inquiries, requesting quotations, or communicating with our engineering and project teams. This may include:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Contact Details:</strong> Name, company designation, business email address, phone number, and physical office/facility address.</li>
            <li><strong>Technical Project Data:</strong> Equipment specifications, technical drawings, CAD files, process requirements, and application details submitted for quotation or manufacturing review.</li>
            <li><strong>Communication Records:</strong> Details of your correspondences, emails, RFQs, and order discussions with our personnel.</li>
            <li><strong>Website Usage Data:</strong> Standard server logs, device type, IP address, and browser data to assist in site performance and security monitoring.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
          <p>The information collected is used strictly for legitimate commercial and engineering purposes, including:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Evaluating technical requirements and formulating equipment quotations.</li>
            <li>Coordinating engineering design, fabrication, inspection, dispatch, and commissioning schedules.</li>
            <li>Responding directly to customer service inquiries and technical queries.</li>
            <li>Complying with statutory, regulatory, and legal obligations applicable in India.</li>
            <li>Enhancing website reliability, user experience, and preventing fraudulent or unauthorized activities.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>3. Confidentiality & Technical Information</h2>
          <p>
            We recognize that technical drawings, engineering designs, and proprietary specifications shared for the purpose of equipment fabrication constitute confidential business data. A.I.T Engineers treats all engineering data and drawings with high confidentiality, ensuring they are only accessible to authorized engineering personnel and fabrication supervisors working directly on your project.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>4. Information Sharing & Disclosure</h2>
          <p>
            We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, trade, or disclose your corporate or personal data to third-party marketing entities. Information may be shared only under the following limited conditions:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Logistics & Freight Partners:</strong> For dispatch, transport, and delivery coordination of fabricated equipment to your plant or jobsite.</li>
            <li><strong>Regulatory & Legal Authorities:</strong> Where disclosure is required by law, taxation authorities, or judicial summons.</li>
            <li><strong>Group Entities:</strong> With associated entities (such as Orbital-GX, Purwanchal Enterprises, or DSI.com) when specifically relevant to joint technical scopes requested by the client.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>5. Data Security & Storage</h2>
          <p>
            We implement reasonable technical, operational, and managerial safeguards to protect your data against unauthorized access, alteration, disclosure, or destruction. However, no internet transmission or electronic storage method can guarantee absolute security.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>6. Cookies and Tracking</h2>
          <p>
            Our website uses minimal standard cookies essential for website functionality and basic performance diagnostics. You can manage or disable cookies through your browser settings, though doing so may affect certain site navigation features.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section">
          <h2>7. Updates to This Policy</h2>
          <p>
            We may periodically revise this Privacy Policy to reflect advancements in our services, statutory requirements, or organizational procedures. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-section legal-contact-box">
          <h2>8. Contact Us Regarding Privacy</h2>
          <p>If you have any questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy or your personal information, please contact our administrative office:</p>
          <div class="contact-card">
            <p><strong>A.I.T Engineers</strong></p>
            <p>Thane, Maharashtra, India</p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@aitengineers.com">info@aitengineers.com</a></p>
            <p>Phone: <a href="tel:+919876543210">+91 98765 43210</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-content {
    padding: 70px 0;
  }

  .legal-card {
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 48px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
    color: var(--c-text, #1f2937);
    line-height: 1.75;
    word-break: break-word;
    overflow-wrap: break-word;
  }

  .legal-meta {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #6b7280;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
  }

  .legal-intro {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: #374151;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .legal-section {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .legal-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    padding-left: 12px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--c-pri, #006A9A);
  }

  .legal-section p {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    color: #4b5563;
  }

  .legal-section ul {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    color: #4b5563;
  }

  .legal-section li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .legal-contact-box {
    margin-top: 48px;
    border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
    padding-top: 32px;
  }

  .contact-card {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 24px;
    margin-top: 16px;
    border-left: 4px solid var(--c-pri, #006A9A);
  }

  .contact-card p {
    margin: 4px 0;
    color: #1e293b;
  }

  .contact-card a {
    color: var(--c-pri, #006A9A);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .contact-card a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .legal-content {
      padding: 36px 0;
    }
    .legal-card {
      padding: 24px 18px;
    }
    .legal-section h2 {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    .legal-intro {
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
  }
</style>
